From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Baptiste Augrain <daiyam@zokugun.org>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: cli: fetch reh server from release archives via explicit endpoints

VSCodium does not run Microsoft's update service, so the CLI's tunnel/serve-web server download is rewired to build URLs from configured endpoints (VSCODE_CLI_DOWNLOAD_ENDPOINT/VSCODE_CLI_UPDATE_ENDPOINT) and app/binary names, pulling the `-reh-web-` archive directly from the release download endpoint instead of the upstream `/api/...` version API (#2313, #2319). The server entrypoint is resolved from the configured binary name rather than the built-in SERVER_NAME_MAP (#2561).

